  <name>Repadio</name>
  <summary>Pure-Rust audio and video player on the Repose GUI framework</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Repadio is a cross-platform audio and video player built as a reference example
      for the Repose GUI framework.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Audio decoding via Symphonia (MP3, FLAC, OGG, WAV, AAC, and more)</li>
      <li>Video decoding via videoson (H.264, H.265, AV1)</li>
      <li>Low-latency playback via CPAL</li>
      <li>Embedded metadata and album art display</li>
      <li>Playlist management with drag-to-reorder</li>
      <li>Cross-platform: Linux, macOS, Windows, Web (WASM), Android</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
  <developer_name>MLM Games</developer_name>
